  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (<NoiseText=1,1>Moni, he left us to go try to kill himself</NoiseText>.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257983
    - rid: 4972360225885257984
    - rid: 4972360225885257985
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh. Oh fu-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257987
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That's-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess the nihilism's affecting him pretty bad.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257988
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I... I really think we shouldn't be leaving him alone.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257990
    - rid: 4972360225885257991
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (D-did he come up with a plan to, you know, or-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257992
    - rid: 4972360225885257993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah. Me getting arrested was what interrupted it.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257994
    - rid: 4972360225885257996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess we're lucky that <i>you're</i> a higher priority, then! Ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360225885257997
    - rid: 4972360225885257998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
