    - rid: 4972360225885258000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (What... what are we supposed to do?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884864
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (What we're supposed to do-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884866
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (We're <i>supposed</i> to call the suicide hotline, get that boy on suicide
      watch, and introduce him to a therapist.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884865
    - rid: 4972360251278884867
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Which are resources that Skyrim doesn't have.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you know if he likes dogs?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884870
    - rid: 4972360251278884871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I dunno...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884872
    - rid: 4972360251278884873
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, if he does, that dog that's following you two-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884874
    - rid: 4972360251278884875
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (His name is Meeko.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884876
    - rid: 4972360251278884877
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (If he does like dogs, caring for Meeko should help- a double dose of
      love and responsibility that <i>should</i> make suicide a bit less attractive.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884878
    - rid: 4972360251278884879
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Though, that's assuming he can manage to not be completely lethargic.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884880
    - rid: 4972360251278884881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Based on how he said "good luck with that," I don't think he's really
      in the mood to do much of anything.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Is there something I could do?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884882
    - rid: 4972360251278884883
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Other than just being there for him? I dunno...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884884
    - rid: 4972360251278884885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... actually...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884886
    - rid: 4972360251278884887
    - rid: 4972360251278884890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whatever you do, don't do anything interesting.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884888
    - rid: 4972360251278884889
    - rid: 4972360251278884891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nothing interesting? Huh?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884892
    - rid: 4972360251278884894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (To be clear, <b>you</b> can't control where you go, right?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884895
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, since the reason <b>you</b> have this icon thing is to interact
      with this world-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884896
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That means <b>you'll</b> follow the action; if there's nothing going
      on with {mc} and Sayori, but there's stuff going on with Natsuki, Yuri, or
      me...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That means <b>you'll</b> be- I don't know, dragged-? To us, away from
      {mc}.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884897
    - rid: 4972360251278884898
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um. How's that supposed to help?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884899
    - rid: 4972360251278884900
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's no secret that {mc} <i>loathes</i> the idea of just being some
      puppet; that his life was specifically <i>made</i> for that purpose.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884901
    - rid: 4972360251278884902
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, while keeping <b>the player</b> away from him doesn't really change
      that fact, it <i>will</i> keep it out of sight, out of mind.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884903
    - rid: 4972360251278884904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... hopefully.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884905
    - rid: 4972360251278884906
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360251278884907
    - rid: 4972360251278884908
    - rid: 4972360251278884909
